{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15842","headline":"寄上礼部李侍郎 · 崔峒","name":"寄上礼部李侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴楚相逢处，江湖共泛时。\n任风舟去远，待月酒行迟。\n白发常同欢，青云本要期。\n贵来君却少，秋至老偏悲。\n玉佩明朝盛，苍苔陋巷滋。\n追寻恨无路，唯有梦相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}